{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03232","headline":"下桂江县黎壁 · 宋之问","name":"下桂江县黎壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"放溜觌前漵，连山分上干。\n江回云壁转，天小雾峯攒。\n吼沫跳急浪，合流环峻滩。\n欹离出漩划，缭绕避涡盘。\n舟子怯桂水，最言斯路难。\n吾生抱忠信，吟啸自安闲。\n旦别已千岁，夜愁劳万端。\n企予见夜月，委曲破林峦。\n潭旷竹烟尽，洲香橘露团。\n岂傲夙所好，对之与俱欢。\n思君罢琴酌，泣此夜漫漫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}